- 1px borders, never heavier. Use --line for structure, --ink for emphasis.
- Radii: 4px on cards, 2px on chips, 0 on chart frames. Never more.
- No box-shadows anywhere except ONE: none. Use borders and background
  tint shifts for elevation. This is non-negotiable.
- Never encode significance with red/green. Use line style (solid vs dashed),
  pill labels, and text. Direction (up/down) uses the trend colors; that's
