ChatPanel:
  Client component. Uses useInvestigation() for context.
  Local state: draft (string), busy (boolean).
  scrollRef: scrolls to bottom when messages.length changes.
  useEffect for pendingPrompt: if region && pendingPrompt, capture the
  pending prompt text, immediately call setPendingPrompt(null), then call
  handleSend(text). Deps: [region, pendingPrompt].

  handleSend(text):
    Trim. If empty or !region, return.
    addMessage({ role: "user", text: trimmed })
    setDraft(""). setBusy(true).
    await 300ms delay (visual feedback).
    Build series = generateSeries(region), stats = computeStats(region, series).
    reply = generateReply(trimmed, region, stats).
    card = addCard({ kind: reply.cardKind, point: point ?? undefined })
    addMessage({ role: "assistant", text: reply.text,
                  cardKind: reply.cardKind, cardId: card.id })
    setBusy(false).

  Render structure per the screen spec above.

ArtifactCanvas:
  Client component. Reads cards from context. Renders empty state or
